// Whole evaluation after constant-diagram introduction. The Cartesian
// inclusion is retained explicitly; arbitrary lax diagrams are not collapsed.
// This is the structural weakening/evaluation beta comparison, not a runtime
// terminal-source eta rule or a mapping-category identification.
unif_rule
  @comp_fapp0 Cat_cat _ _ _
    (@comp_fapp0 Cat_cat _ _ _ (@fapp0_func $I $C _) (Functor_cart_include $I $C))
    (@Const_func_func $I $C)
  ≡ @id Cat_cat $C0
  ↪ [ $C0 ≡ $C ];
